1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:06,176
You made something worth paying for. A beat pack. A guide. A secret recipe.

2
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:14,480
But selling it online means sign-ups, a cut of every sale, and waiting weeks to get paid.

3
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:22,575
Meet Unlock. Sell anything for Bitcoin Cash — with one link.

4
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:33,727
Add a secret, a link, or a file. Set a price in dollars, choose where you get paid, and your link is ready. Listing is free.

5
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:48,594
Your buyer opens the link, and taps pay. Their own wallet signs it: Paytaca, Cashonize, any WizardConnect wallet. Seconds later, the content unlocks.

6
00:00:51,600 --> 00:01:01,921
It's one Bitcoin Cash transaction. The price goes straight to the seller — every cent. A small fee mints the receipt. And Unlock never holds the money.

7
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:15,517
The buyer also gets an NFT receipt — a CashToken. It re-opens the content on any device. Gift it, or resell it, and access goes with it.

8
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:26,038
Sellers can get paid at their Nostr name, instead of a long address. Two signatures link the keys, so buyers see a verified badge.

9
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:37,750
No accounts. No emails. No middlemen. Just Bitcoin Cash. Try it today, at unlock-bch.pages.dev.
